VERDICT: REJECTED

The project is not ready to mark complete because its configured lint command fails with three newly introduced errors in `app/index.tsx`: the memoized draggable component lacks a display name, and JSX contains unescaped double quotes. This leaves the repository failing a standard project validation step despite the router migration and redesign otherwise type-checking successfully (`tsc --noEmit` passes).

Security: none observed; SAST reported no findings.

Next actions:
1. Resolve all lint errors (and preferably the two hook-dependency warnings) in `app/index.tsx`.
2. Re-run `npm run lint` and `npx tsc --noEmit` successfully before reporting task #1 complete.
3. Smoke-test the configured Expo web startup after the route migration.

